{
  "$comment": "GlowAlchemy Theme — SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for the entire UI. Edit this file and run `node src/design-system/generate.mjs`. It generates src/theme/tokens.css (CSS variables) and is read by tailwind.config.js and src/theme/muiTheme.js. Never hardcode brand colors in components.",
